WEBVTT

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:19.490
The months that pass within my dreams

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:23.410
I cast aside my worldly desires 
along with my black hair

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:29.670
If I turn around, the stories of the 
past would appear before my eyes

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.130
In a drunken haze, I laugh at the world

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:39.010
Shangri-la is nowhere to be found

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:44.810
No one knows the love of the spring wind

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:54.030
The beginning and the 
end repeat over and over

00:00:54.610 --> 00:01:01.990
Trading places, they bloom then wilt

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:05.830
In January, I pick a flower with no petals

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:13.170
In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:17.680
In March, the peach blossoms bloom

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:24.640
In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:28.690
In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:32.780
In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:42.740
<b>6: Bait</b>

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:44.820
Kan Suidan!

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:46.740
You can't run!

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:49.750
What?

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:55.640
<i>Impossible! He erased my flames?</i>

00:01:55.990 --> 00:01:58.180
Kouhin has finally noticed.

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:00.550
Huh? What do you mean?

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:03.590
The trap of the bukou style's Qimen Dunjia.

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:08.060
The closer he gets to Shokatsu Sei, 
the more trouble he has using his power.

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:15.700
Kouhin can back off now, but he's already 
within the luopan that Shokatsu Sei created.

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:21.740
When he finally attacks, 
the match will be over.

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:37.890
What's wrong?

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:41.090
<i>Damn.</i>

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:44.950
<i>Not enough. It's not enough.</i>

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:46.880
<i>It's still not nearly hot enough!</i>

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:50.330
Shokatsu Sei!

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:56.570
Even though I'm fighting someone as powerful 
as you, my spirit is hardly burning!

00:02:56.920 --> 00:02:59.320
Give me everything you've got!

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.640
Don't hold back!

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:06.040
Sorry about that.

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:10.160
In that case, I'll get a little hotter, too.

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:11.560
Rin!

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:11.460
<b>Rin</b>

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:16.360
He dares to challenge me with fire?

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:18.490
Don't mock me!

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:22.380
<b>Kinchou Bakuen</b>

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:22.460
Kinchou Bakuen!

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:25.510
<b>Sekiren</b>

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:25.680
Sekiren!

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:42.820
It's too dangerous here!

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:44.260
Don't push! Leave the arena!

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:44.260
Get outside, quickly!

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:46.450
Please evacuate immediately!

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:45.720
Hurry!

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:50.500
What's all this commotion?

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.300
Is the match over?

00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:01.470
<i>What? He's overwhelming me, a fire user?</i>

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:05.870
<i>Only my master should be 
able to defeat my flames.</i>

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:08.690
Damn it!

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:28.780
There's no way I can beat that monster!

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:34.920
Impressive victory, Shokatsu Sei-san.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:39.150
However, in a disastrous turn of events, 
the arena caught fire after your match.

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:41.260
Do you have anything to say about that?

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:45.260
I would've preferred not to cause harm,

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:51.930
but some hot-headed idiot gave up on the 
match and nearly died, so I had no choice.

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:55.310
Is there something you want to say?

00:04:55.820 --> 00:05:02.120
You damn fox. If you'd finished me off, 
this fire never would've happened.

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:05.060
I was prepared to die.

00:05:05.060 --> 00:05:07.560
But you held back until the very end.

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:09.730
Held back, huh?

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:15.250
You're the first difficult opponent 
I've faced in this tournament,

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:18.830
and I'm not just saying that because I won.

00:05:19.240 --> 00:05:24.760
If you hadn't fallen for my Qimen Dunjia and 
it'd been a simple contest of fire techniques,

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:28.180
I wouldn't have stood a chance against 
you, even if there were two of me.

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:31.800
You wouldn't have stood a chance?

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:35.240
Of course not.

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:38.610
If not for your tricks, I would've won.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:43.490
Our next battle will be 
even hotter, Shokatsu Sei.

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:47.400
Next time we'll determine 
who truly is better.

00:05:49.270 --> 00:05:51.810
Hey, forget that interview we just did!

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:53.440
Let's do it over!

00:05:53.810 --> 00:05:57.140
<i>This guy is kind of a pain...</i>

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:59.100
By the way, Shokatsu Sei-san.

00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:05.760
The Shokatsu family isn't known for standing 
center stage in the world of outsiders.

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:09.730
Why did you decide to participate 
in this tournament?

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:13.050
No real reason.

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:16.720
We just wanted to test our strength.

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:19.760
Your strength?

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:23.110
Shokatsu Sei-san, it seems 
to me you already possess

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:26.720
far greater strength than 
your peers your age.

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:29.980
Just how high are you aiming?

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:33.190
Could it be... that?

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:35.960
Ah, you mean uka?

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:41.520
You believe in myths of men growing wings
and becoming transcendent beings?

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:43.800
Stop, Hou-nee!

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.680
You don't have to bury Shokatsu Sei!

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:48.390
Calm down, Houhou!

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:53.110
I'll give it my best shot, okay?

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:55.000
You're Chou Soran, aren't you?

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:58.350
I'm with the Yousei Company,

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:02.810
a group of outsiders that provides 
assistance and information to other outsiders.

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:06.330
Would you be willing to do an interview?

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:09.250
Jo San-sama, I'd appreciate 
it if you would, too.

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:12.320
Tell me about the Express Delivery Company.

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:24.800
Now that's sour.

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:32.090
Want a tangerine, Fuu Houhou?

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:39.190
How can you eat something so sour?

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:42.710
Food should be eaten 
quickly when you have it.

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:46.260
Otherwise you'll get hungry 
when there's no food.

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:49.530
Really? Interesting attitude.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:52.790
Jo San's grandfather taught me that.

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:55.180
Is his grandfather poor?

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:58.540
Then you should support him.

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:01.910
You must make good money working 
for the Express Delivery Company.

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:05.620
He died a long time ago.

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:08.380
We were all poor back then.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:12.010
Oh? A long time ago...

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:13.710
When might that have b—

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:17.020
Sorry about that.

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:19.390
We've got something to 
do, so we'd better go.

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.110
We're leaving now, Jo San!

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:23.990
Huh? Where are you going, Soran-kun?

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:26.190
Jo Yon told us to come watch the match!

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:29.940
Well? Get anything out of her?

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:32.180
Almost.

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:37.180
But we will solve the mystery.

00:08:42.320 --> 00:08:44.490
Looks like they've already started.

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:47.220
Ah, you guys are here.

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:49.000
This match will be worth watching.

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:54.250
It's shinki user Shoushou versus 
zenshin style Ryuumon user Koumei.

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:06.790
Gyou!

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:12.590
No way!

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:16.860
His soul hasn't been ripped out of him 
despite all the shinki he's taken?

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:20.150
Shoushou's been pitted 
against his worst match-up.

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:21.360
What does that mean?

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:26.800
The physical bodies we can 
see are known as "mei."

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:36.930
<b>Mei</b>

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:33.240
Spirits or souls without physical 
form are known as "sei."

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:36.930
<b>Sei</b>

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:36.930
The idea behind the zenshin 
style is Seimei Ryoushuu.

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:41.000
In other words, to simultaneously 
train both sei and mei.

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:48.340
They abandon all notion of martial arts and 
simply train their bodies and spirits.

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:54.850
Shoushou can try to rip out his opponent's 
soul using shinki, but it won't be easy.

00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:59.600
Koumei, this isn't a battle to the death.

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:03.430
It's meant to be a friendly competition.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:06.460
I've been holding back.

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:10.130
But I can't any longer.

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:13.800
I won't be able to beat you if I do.

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:17.380
That's fine, Shoushou-san.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:20.990
I already noticed you've been holding back.

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:24.060
But I'm approaching my limit.

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:27.140
You're a much stronger 
martial artist than I am.

00:10:27.530 --> 00:10:31.850
So I'll use my special technique, as well.

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:40.370
Shoushou-san, you don't need 
to tear out my soul anymore.

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:43.560
I'll tear it out myself.

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:46.840
What?

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:47.910
There it is!

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:49.880
Shutsuyoujin!

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:51.540
Be careful.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:57.810
I'll be attacking your soul from here on.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:05.990
Wh-What is that?

00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:08.300
He turned into a ghost!

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:12.060
That's a Zenshi Sect kung fu 
technique that involves separating

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:14.150
your soul from your body and controlling it.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:20.200
Warriors of the Zenshi Sect based on Seimei 
Ryoushuu have not only strong bodies,

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:23.870
but unimaginably strong souls.

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:26.650
<i>He's fast.</i>

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:30.090
<i>I can't believe this style of kung fu exists.</i>

00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:35.800
<i>But if his soul has left it, 
then his body must be empty.</i>

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:37.080
<i>Fool!</i>

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:48.200
<i>I-I can't breathe...</i>

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:51.770
<i>What is this?</i>

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:55.900
I told you, Shoushou-san.

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:59.610
Now that I'm a spirit, I'll attack yours.

00:12:00.640 --> 00:12:05.300
With how fast I am now, you won't 
have a chance to attack my body.

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:11.190
And I've already seen through your shinki.

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:17.500
Too slow!

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.430
Now!

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:23.420
What?

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:33.300
Sorry, Koumei.

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:37.450
I've dispersed your soul for a while.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:46.360
Sorry for the trouble my junior caused!

00:12:47.110 --> 00:12:48.580
You idiot!

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:52.160
How dare you use the Shutsuyoujin 
without sufficient training?!

00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:57.590
<i>He suffered no damage when I used 
my shinki against his soul.</i>

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:01.660
<i>Are those of the Zenshin Sect even human?</i>

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:02.870
Wait, you amateur!

00:13:02.870 --> 00:13:04.750
Surrender already!

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:05.630
I'm sorry!

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:08.920
You're right, brother! I surrender!

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:12.850
Who was that bearded guy?

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:16.900
Ryuu Kouyou of Hakuunkan, 
head temple of the Zenshin Sect.

00:13:17.260 --> 00:13:19.550
I had no idea he was so strong.

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:22.020
And I can't believe he's a ghost!

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:28.390
Shutsuyoujin wasn't designed for combat.

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:33.370
It's what naturally occurs once your 
soul has reached a certain strength.

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:36.390
Souls are weak and difficult to train.

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:40.310
Repairing a damaged soul 
is incredibly difficult.

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:46.020
But Ryuu Kouyou took a direct 
hit from Shoushou's shinki.

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:51.230
It's a hundred times harder than defending 
against a sword with your bare hands.

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:53.100
It's not fair.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:55.300
Being a ghost must be cheating.

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:56.970
Express Delivery Company.

00:13:57.220 --> 00:14:00.190
Uh, Riku Rinron?

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:02.160
Is the match over?

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:07.200
I'm ready now. Feel free 
to head over anytime.

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:11.160
Shall we go?

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:16.520
There's something we have to do 
besides appear in the tournament.

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:27.650
We're on our way to see the 
Tenshi and Rikukin-sama, right?

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:28.610
That's right.

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:32.790
Then isn't it better not to
bring Hou-nee with us?

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:37.610
But we can't leave Houhou unattended.

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:42.390
But if Hou-nee's past is connected 
to the Koushin War...

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:45.590
The Ten Elders went through that war.

00:14:45.970 --> 00:14:49.070
One of them might know about Hou-nee.

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:53.400
Soran, what do you want to do?

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:56.960
Ideally, I'd like to avoid having 
Hou-nee meet the Elders.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:05.000
That's why I called you instead of her 
when I was summoned by Ro Ji and Ou Ai.

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:09.510
Hou-nee still ended up meeting them, though.

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:13.080
Maybe I'm worrying about it too much.

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:16.940
Meeting the Tenshi should be 
safer than Ro Ji or Ou Ai, at least.

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:22.390
I just thought we should be more 
careful of Hou-nee's circumstances.

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:27.820
<i>Dad, you saw everything.</i>

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:33.980
<i>I'm finally starting to understand 
why you entrusted Houhou to Soran.</i>

00:15:35.760 --> 00:15:36.920
In here.

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:42.350
It's been a while, Jo San and Jo Yon.

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:44.110
Soran, come in.

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:50.080
No need to be so tense, Soran.

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:52.380
This is Den Shinchuu.

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:56.080
He was a fellow disciple of 
your grandfather Chou Kaigi.

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:58.640
That makes him your master.

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:05.010
Shinchuu, Kaigi, and I 
were once great friends.

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:09.690
My, my! Master Den Shinchuu!

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:12.080
It's an honor to meet you!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:15.100
<i>He's already laying it on thick.</i>

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:17.110
<i>He really is shameless...</i>

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:19.940
This must be Master Rikukin!

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:22.460
I've been looking forward to meeting you!

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:26.910
I don't deserve your worship.

00:16:26.910 --> 00:16:28.550
Oh, please.

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:31.670
I've been wanting to 
thank you, Rikukin-sama.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:35.680
The number of participants in the Raten 
Taishou increased and I'll be able to face off

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:38.970
against powerful opponents because you 
offered your Tsuutenroku as a prize.

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:40.400
Thank you.

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:46.360
He's being sarcastic to me? Very gutsy.

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:51.070
Of course he is. 
After all, he's Kaigi's grandson.

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:52.820
You got me.

00:16:53.350 --> 00:16:55.890
Sorry for burdening you 
with more troubles, Soran.

00:16:56.240 --> 00:17:01.080
In exchange, I'll do any favor for you.

00:17:02.050 --> 00:17:04.960
Thank you, Rikukin-sama.

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:10.990
By the way, who's that girl behind you?

00:17:11.990 --> 00:17:14.960
Oh, she's one of our employees.

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:17.390
She's participating in 
the tournament, as well.

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:36.690
Rikukin.

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:39.770
Let's discuss what we're here for.

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.110
Bring him.

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:52.830
That's Koketsu of the Tougousou!

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:59.480
We've been observing Koketsu since 
he became an agent of Zensei.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:03.760
We'd been letting him run free 
in order to find Zensei's trail.

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:09.390
But having become a murderer, Koketsu began 
hunting outsiders here at Ryuukosan.

00:18:09.390 --> 00:18:10.600
However...

00:18:15.050 --> 00:18:16.660
T-Tou Yuufuku did?

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:22.250
Yes. Tou Yuufuku, shaman of Hakutousan—

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:26.750
Rather, to be precise, Ryuu Konsei, 
a sprite possessing Tou Yuufuku,

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:29.330
turned the tables on Koketsu.

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:33.600
Do you want to die, boy?

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:39.120
A sprite? Those actually exist?

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:43.320
All living creatures possess ki.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:47.560
A sprite is an animal that has trained its ki.

00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:52.810
But it's highly unusual for an 
animal to be able to use its ki.

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:58.100
Training it requires opening the 
doors of the heart and mind.

00:18:58.100 --> 00:19:00.560
It's incredibly difficult.

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:04.790
But when naturally simple 
animals master their ki,

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:07.710
they develop far more quickly than humans.

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:11.460
Animals who have trained 
their ki and become sprites

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:15.050
are known as "sen" where Tou Yuufuku is from.

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:20.660
And the shamans have a kung fu 
technique called "Shutsuba."

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:26.350
They form contracts with sen 
and borrow their strength.

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:29.470
Yuufuku, you fool.

00:19:29.470 --> 00:19:34.220
You summoned me to fight this weakling?

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:38.050
Now, now. Don't be angry.

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:43.080
I never thought I'd see a sen at my age.

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:48.320
I thought the shamanistic arts 
of Hakutousan had died off.

00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:51.700
You seem somewhat skilled in kung fu.

00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:56.340
Would you like to play with me?

00:19:57.910 --> 00:19:59.710
I wouldn't dream of it.

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:02.020
Master, what is your name?

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:05.400
Ryuu Konsei of Hakutousan.

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:10.350
Oh?

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:15.810
Do you pests intend to fight me?

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:18.990
Please don't get the 
wrong idea, Ryuu-sensei.

00:20:19.350 --> 00:20:24.250
We have business with that man you captured.

00:20:26.230 --> 00:20:31.200
We somehow convinced him 
to give Koketsu to us.

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:34.460
We meant to interrogate 
him about Zensei's plans,

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:38.000
but he can't even speak 
properly in this state.

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:42.540
He's been almost entirely 
incapacitated by his technique.

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:45.320
I-Is really he okay?

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:46.720
He won't suddenly attack, will he?

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:50.310
Don't worry about that.

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:52.520
I used this on him.

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:54.860
This is a Heiganbari.

00:20:54.860 --> 00:21:00.020
Stick this in someone's Governing Vessel, 
and they won't be able to use their kung fu.

00:21:00.990 --> 00:21:04.750
I doubt there's anything you can ask him.

00:21:04.750 --> 00:21:06.650
He probably doesn't know anything.

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:12.040
Rikukin-sama, when you announced you'd 
give your Tsuutenroku as a prize,

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:15.120
they secretly contacted our company.

00:21:15.940 --> 00:21:19.740
They came here for the same reason we did.

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:24.550
We're waiting for Zensei at Ryuukosan.

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:27.450
What are you talking about?

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:30.140
We hadn't told you yet, Soran-kun.

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:33.220
Many of our employees have 
infiltrated the mountain, too.

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:41.700
Your kitaigen style and my Tsuutenroku 
were bait to draw out Zensei.

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:44.070
And once they take the bait,

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:49.530
we'll be able to round up of all 
of them here at Ryuukosan.

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:56.500
The sun came up, aiya, and it’s 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya

00:21:56.710 --> 00:22:00.460
The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:04.550
There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they’re fat and look delicious

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:08.470
But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:12.600
But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers

00:22:14.060 --> 00:22:16.690
Cute, cute girl

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:20.560
She has such a calm face

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:24.490
But with her giant shovel, she 
goes from one hill to the next

00:22:24.740 --> 00:22:28.070
And fills them with holes

00:22:28.610 --> 00:22:32.330
I don’t know where she came from

00:22:32.580 --> 00:22:36.160
But if you make her mad, she’ll punch you

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:40.290
She’s always in a daze, 
but she’s terrifying

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:44.090
She’ll smack you without 
warning if you’re stupid

00:22:44.710 --> 00:22:48.220
Even in dark places where 
the moon doesn’t shine

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:52.180
This dignified girl is never scared

00:22:52.430 --> 00:22:56.270
She works hard all night burying

00:22:56.520 --> 00:23:00.440
She buries others in order to survive

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:04.690
The sun came up, aiya, and it’s 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya

00:23:04.900 --> 00:23:08.570
The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through

00:23:08.780 --> 00:23:12.450
There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they’re fat and look delicious

00:23:12.740 --> 00:23:16.540
But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:19.290
But I don’t want any if you 
don’t have red peppers...

00:23:19.670 --> 00:23:21.630
I don’t, I don’t, I don’t!

