Hey, Jo San. What kind of 
organization is Zensei?

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:27.810
Good question, Soran-kun.

00:23:28.320 --> 00:23:29.880
Zensei is...

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:34.110
Whoops, looks like we're out of time.

00:23:34.110 --> 00:23:34.730
Huh?!

